## Hard Rules — Never Violate

### Zero network calls
```typescript
// ❌ NEVER — no calls to any external endpoint
fetch('https://api.autocsr.io/sessions', { method: 'POST', body: ... })
chrome.runtime.sendNativeMessage(...)
XMLHttpRequest

// ✅ Only storage targets allowed
chrome.storage.local.set(...)
chrome.storage.session.get(...)
```

### Encrypt before every write
```typescript
// ❌ Never write plaintext to storage
await chrome.storage.local.set({ message: rawText })

// ✅ Always encrypt first
const encrypted = await vault.encrypt(rawText)
await chrome.storage.local.set({ message: encrypted })
```

### ARIA + data-attributes only — never CSS classes
```typescript
// ❌ CSS classes break when LiveAgent deploys an update
document.querySelectorAll('.lt-message-text')
document.querySelectorAll('.chat-bubble-content')

// ✅ Stable selectors
document.querySelector('[role="log"]')
document.querySelectorAll('[data-testid*="message"]')
document.querySelectorAll('[aria-label*="message"]')
```

